### Create User - admin + triator (areaId pode ser null)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chico",
  "email": "chico@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345",
  "areaId": null,
  "roles": ["admin"]
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "chico@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345"
}

### Select Role - usar loginToken no Authorization header
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/auth/select-role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginToken}}

{
  "role": "admin"
}

### Refresh Access Token - usar refreshToken no Authorization header
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/refresh-token
Authorization: Bearer {{refreshToken}}

### Get Roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/roles?email=chico@gmail.com

### Exemplo endpoint protegido
GET {{baseUrl}}/history/6
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}